<h3><u>Je karta he mera mawla</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><strong><u>Je karta he mera mawla</u></strong></p>

<p>Ye virsa marte, Marte bhi, ye virsa marte, marte bhi, hum naslo ko dejayenge</p>

<p>(Majlis matam karwayenge) x2 Je karta hai mere mawla, sab karbobala ko jayenge (Majlis matam karwayenge)</p>

<p>Ham khun ali akber ki kasam nauha sugra ka sunayenge</p>

<ol>
 <li>(Gazi ka alam utayange) x2 Dunya se kafle ayenge</li>
 <li>Jab Subh ho hogi, karbal me, (ham khake shifaa ko chumange) x3 Din rat waha sab ehle azaa, Mawla ka sog manayenge</li>
 <li>Jab dekhe chand muharram ka, (Sab jaye khayame hussaini par) x3 Abbas ke khayme par rukh kar gab izne ziyaraat payenge</li>
 <li>Jab ponchenge use manzil par (Asgher ke lagaa tha tir jahaa) x3 Bulwayenge nane bacho ko subeko pani pilwayenge</li>
 <li>Matam na rukenga ehle aza (akber ka jaha neza tha laga) x3</li>
 <li>Darya ke kanara beth ke ham (royenge wo manzar soch ke ham) x3 Jab khun me bhara aya tha alam ye soch ke ashk bahayenge</li>
 <li>Jab aath muharram ayenge (bacho ko banayenge sakaa) x3 us roz sajaa kar mashk o - alam sharbat pe nazar dilwayenge</li>
 <li>Jab shaam-e ghariba ayaangi (kya kya na hama rulwayengi) x3 Ek jalte huwe jula ki shabi yaad ayi to marjayengi</li>
 <li>Jis tila se Zainab ne kabhi (kat te huwa dekha bhayyi ka sar) x3 yaad ayenga roze ashura sine se gham phat jayenge</li>
 <li>Ashur ka din jab hogaya (Mawla se kahenge roro kar) x3 Daman me chupalijiye mawla ham lot ke gar na jayenge</li>
</ol>

<p>(Majlis matam karwayenge) x2 Je karta hai mere mawla, sub karbobala ko jayenge (Majlis matam karwayenge)</p>
</p>